{"id":"n75781-4-4","stage":1,"title":"정리 · 整理","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75781-4-4-1","ko":"민준이가 요즘 왜 이렇게 힘들어 하니?","zh":"敏俊最近怎么这么辛苦啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfa